      "message": "fix(operation): pin cross-hole stamp digest and fix 1 nm lattice wording\n\nAdd unit tests in operation::hole_digest pinning every CrossHole field\n(origin.{x,y,z}, dir.{x,y,z}, radius, entry_d, floor_d, through) through\nboth hole_digest::cross and OpParams::Drill::stamp_with, including\nsub-half-step lattice invariance on snapped fields and verbatim hashing\non dir. Update the 1 um / half-micron comments in hole_digest.rs to\nreflect cl::lattice's 1 nm (1e-6 mm) step.\n\nFixes #1625",
